'''Anchor's Edge''' is an [[Alliance]] outpost located on an island off the coast of the Barrens, to the south of the Echo Isles. It was established by the second wave of Kul Tiran forces led by [[Lieutenant Alverold]] to reinforce [[Lieutenant Benedict]] at [[Tiragarde Keep]] following the end of his expedition around Kalimdor.

